#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read about how we decide on the types of problems we think might benefit "
"from a quantum solution, and look at some recent examples of work from the "
"community."
msgstr ""
"Baca tentang bagaimana kita menentukan jenis masalah yang mungkin mendapat "
"manfaat dari solusi kuantum, dan lihat beberapa contoh terbaru dari "
"komunitas."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Which problems are quantum computers good for?"
msgstr "Masalah apa yang cocok untuk komputer kuantum?"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore QSVM */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore QSVM */}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Watch the video on applications of quantum computing from Olivia Lanes, or "
"open the video in a separate window on "
"[YouTube.](https://youtu.be/33QmsXhIlpU)\n"
msgstr ""
"Tonton video tentang aplikasi komputasi kuantum dari Olivia Lanes, atau buka"
" video di jendela terpisah di [YouTube.](https://youtu.be/33QmsXhIlpU)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<IBMVideo id=\"134063426\" title=\"In this video, Olivia Lanes describes "
"several possible applications of quantum computing at the utility scale. "
"These include simulating hadrons and spin glasses, as well as modeling "
